# Artifact laporan coverage (mcov/msim) — dihasilkan saat testing
# Artifact coverage (mcov/msim) di root — dari run test/tool di workspace;
# namanya = nama top module (ct_*, tb_*, dsb) → pola generik, bukan per-nama.
/*.coverage.html
/*.coverage.json
/*.coverage.ucis.xml
/covtest.coverage.html
/covtest.ucis.xml

# ── Fixture & corpus MILIK repo (bukan file eksternal) — wajib di-track ──
# Test RTL CPU emu + seed corpus fuzz + filelist bench. Tanpa ini fresh
# checkout / CI kehilangan sumber → test gagal (path-relative ke repo).
!examples/rtl/*.sv
!examples/rtl/*.v
!examples/synth/*.sv
!crates/mivon-fuzz/fuzz/corpus/seeds/*.sv
!crates/mivon-fuzz/fuzz/corpus/mv/*.mv
# Contoh Mivon HDL + hasil generate-nya (Keputusan Desain MIVON-HDL.md #3:
# hasil generate di-commit) — pola sama dgn examples/rtl. Recursive karena ada
# subdir: `multifile/`, `mvh_header/`, dan `negative/` (fixture sengaja tidak
# valid yang TIDAK ikut `mgen examples/mv`).
!examples/mv/**/*.mv
!examples/mv/**/*.sv
!examples/mv/**/*.svh
!crates/mivon-fuzz/fuzz/corpus/mv/*.sv